Is there anyone out there that knows what the last version of the F16
flightsimulator FALCON for the Apple Macintosh? 
The verion we've got is copyrighted 1987.
Also, we've had problems with a bug in the medal-display. When you finished
a mission that will award a medal (For example, completing the Dragons Tail
without using a ECM-pod) and the awardsscreen appear nothing happens, No prior
medals or scores ar displayed, just the snapshots of the mission, Then after
a while of nothing the computer bombs with a system error 2.
Several examples of the program has behaved on exactly the same way, The only
medal we've ever seen displayed successfully is the Purple Heart.
Solutions anyone?

So now when we'll decided to buy the program (the latest version) we were
wondering if there *is* a later version than the one we got!

